<%- include("partials/header.ejs") %>

<main class="minor-page about-page">
    <div class="minor-page-container">

        <!-- page header  -->
        <div class="minor-page-header">
            <span class="minor-page-eyebrow">ABOUT CRUMBELLE</span>
            <h1 class="minor-page-title">Moments made sweeter.</h1>
            <p class="minor-page-intro">Crumbelle is a bakery built around a simple idea: the things we remember most often begin with the things we share.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- brand into -->
        <section class="minor-page-section about-intro-section">
            <div class="about-intro-grid">

                <div class="about-intro-content">
                    <span class="minor-page-section-label">THE CRUMBELLE WAY</span>
                    <h2 class="minor-page-section-title">Made with care, meant to be remembered.</h2>
                    <p class="minor-page-text">Crumbelle was created for the moments that deserve something a little more special - a 
                        quiet morning, an afternoon treat, a table full of friends, or a celebration shared with the people who matter most.
                    </p>
                    <p class="minor-page-text">We bring together thoughtful ingredients, careful baking, and a love for beautiful details 
                        to create sweet treats that feel at home in both everyday moments and unforgettable celebrations. 
                    </p>
                    <p class="minor-page-text">Because for us, baking is never only about what comes out of the over. It is about how it makes a moment feel.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="about-intro-highlight">
                    <span class="about-hightlight-number">01</span>
                    <h3>Freshness you can taste.</h3>
                    <p>From the first mix to the final finish, every bake is approached with patience, care, and attention to the little details that make a difference.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- our philosophy  -->
        <section class="minor-page-section">

            <div class="minor-page-section-heading">
                <span class="minor-page-section-label">WHAT MATTERS TO US</span>
                <h2 class="minor-page-section-title">Good baking starts with good choices.</h2>
                <p class="minor-page-section-intro">Every Crumbelle bake is guided by a few simple principles: quality ingredients, 
                    thoughtful craftsmanship, and making something people genuinely enjoy sharing.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="minor-page-card-grid">

                <article class="minor-page-card">
                    <div class="minor-page-card-icon">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-gem"></i>
                        <h3>Thoughtful Ingredients</h3>
                        <p>We believe beautiful baking begins with ingredients chosen for their quality, flavour, and the difference
                            they make in the final bite.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </article>

                <article class="minor-page-card">
                    <div class="minor-page-card-icon">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-wand-magic-sparkles"></i>
                        <h3>Crafted with Care</h3>
                        <p>We pay attention to the details - from texture and flavour to finishing touches - because little things
                            can make something feel extraordinary.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </article>

                <article class="minor-page-card">
                    <div class="minor-page-card-icon">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-heart"></i>
                        <h3>Made with Love</h3>
                        <p>There is something special about food made with intention. Every Crumbelle treat is created to bring a 
                            little warmth to the person receiving it.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </article>

                <article class="minor-page-card">
                    <div class="minor-page-card-icon">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-people-group"></i>
                        <h3>Made to Share</h3>
                        <p>From a box of cookies to a celebration cake, our bakes are made for the conversations, gatherings, and
                            moments that happen around them.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </article>

            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- what we bake  -->
        <section class="minor-page-section">

            <div class="minor-page-section-heading">
                <span class="minor-page-section-label">FROM OUR OVEN</span>
                <h2 class="minor-page-section-title">A little something for every kind of craving.</h2>
                <p class="minor-page-section-intro">Our collection brings together familiar favourites and indulgent treats, created for 
                    slow mornings, afternoon cravings, thoughtful gifts, and celebrations big and small.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="minor-page-card-grid">

                <article class="minor-page-card">
                    <div class="minor-page-card-icon">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-bread-slice"></i>
                        <h3>Breads</h3>
                        <p>From rustic loaves and sourdough to buttery brioche, baguettes, focaccia, and other freshly baked favourites.</p>
                    </div>
                </article>

