                        <h3>Pastries</h3>
                        <p>Flaky croissants, delicate Danishes, cinnamon rolls, and classic pastries made for an indulgent start to the day.</p>
                    </div>
                </article>

                <article class="minor-page-card">
                    <div class="minor-page-card-icon">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-cookie-bite"></i>
                        <h3>Sweet Treats</h3>
                        <p>Cookies, brownies, blondies, tarts, cheesecakes, and other little treats for whenever the craving calls.</p>
                    </div>
                </article>

                <article class="minor-page-card">
                    <div class="minor-page-card-icon">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-cake-candles"></i>
                        <h3>Cakes & Celebrations</h3>
                        <p>Beautiful cakes and thoughtfully curated treats made to have a place at birthdays, gatherings, milestones,
                            and everything worth celebrating.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </article>

            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- the idea behind the brand -->
         <section class="minor-page-section about-assortment-section">

            <div class="about-assortment-content">
                <span class="minor-page-section-label">THE IDEA BEHIND CRUMBELLE</span>
                <h2 class="minor-page-section-title">Because the best memories often come with something delicious.</h2>
                <p class="minor-page-text">We want Crumbelle to be more than a place to order baked goods. We want it to be part of the 
                    little rituals and meaningful occasions that make life feel special.
                </p>
                <p class="minor-page-text">The pastry picked up on the way to work. The box of cookies brought to a friend's house. The 
                    cake waiting at the centre of a celebration. The small treat you quietly get for yourself.
                </p>
                <p class="minor-page-text">These are the moments we bake for.</p>
                <a href="/shop" class="minor-page-primary-button">
                    Explore Our Bakes
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i>
                </a>
            </div>

        </section>

        <!-- closing -->
        <section class="minor-page-closing">
            <span class="minor-page-closing-eyebrow">FROM CRUMBELLE, WITH LOVE</span>
            <h2>You bring the moment. We'll bring something sweet.</h2>
            <p>Thank you for letting Crumbelle be part of your everyday cravings, celebrations, and everything in between.</p>
        </section>
        
    </div>
</main>

